; The plaza fountain, as the plaza mounts it. Editor-owned. Its shape is
; `assets/source/props/plaza_fountain.blend` since 2026-09-27, sent with the
; Keep Your Ticket panel's Send to game to `assets/props/plaza_fountain.glb`;
; before that `tools/gen_props.gd` built it. Its materials are
; `assets/materials/plaza_fountain/*.tres`, by the Blender material's name, in
; the GLB's import settings.
